{"articleNo":"2576","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2576&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 타대학(한국교원대학교) 수학신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.23","hit":"11057","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2576&attachNo=1836"},{"name":"2010-2학기 한국교원대학교 수학 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2576&attachNo=2033"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;한국교원대학교 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 지원자격 : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 본교 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 수학기간 : 타대학에서 2개 학기(1년) 이내로 수학 가능.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출서류 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 제출서류(첨부파일)&nbsp;: 타대학 수학 신청원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 제출장소 : 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청기한 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 7. 28(수)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 수학기간 : 2010. 8. 30(월) ~ 12. 10(금)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 등록금 납부 : 소속대학교에 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">. 수업시간표 열람 및 유의사항 등 : 붙임 공고문 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 취득학점 : 학기당 18학점 이내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;9. 기타<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◆&nbsp; 문의사항&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국교원대학교 학사관리과(☎ 043</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-230-3220)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 금오공과대학교 종합학사행정실(각관 1층)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (테크노관 478-7359/디지털관&nbsp; 478-7751/글로벌관 478-7598)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\